{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993634762353001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"sly-sloth-bay","assignee":"","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Joe Oakhart","head_sha":"32f6c01242aa84544d6ea77a721e112c1f6422db","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: 5308-585b-169f-4a35","material: 9501dc6028afcc4c","model: claude-sonnet-4-6","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 3","regver: bb57585159a067c5","verified-at-sha:1fb66466d956f11605c8e0294204aa475a87a15c"],"signature":"57ef1b91120ed7d3a2ce10acf9a336779f56e6de33685e5aa05e5ed921ed4ead","signed_at":1783117448223369000}},"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":8},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1783116517217194001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"3264ec7e-480a-4c39-b242-90c947e62433","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"29a6-59d1-a3ba-40ee"}],"description":"## Why\nS2 (urge-brook-plume) named a `merge_change_409_guard` journald event in its plan's What section for the review-bot's merge-change path. S2 implemented the guard STRUCTURALLY — a merge revision (>= 2 parents) cannot use Gerrit's bare `/patch` endpoint (it returns HTTP 409 'Revision has too many parents'), so voter.review_and_vote branches on `is_merge` BEFORE any diff fetch and routes merges through the auto-merge-delta path (`_assemble_merge_diff`) instead of `gc.get_patch` (src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:393 vs :426; unit test asserts get_patch_calls==0 on merges). BUT the named observability event was NEVER emitted (`grep merge_change_409_guard src/` = 0 hits) — so the guard fires silently. S2's completion verifier flagged this as a valid gap; it was deferred to this follow-up.\n\n## What\n- Emit a structured `merge_change_409_guard` journald event (via the voter's `_emit`, same shape as `merge_detection`/`merge_change_review`) at the point the code enters the is_merge branch and deliberately avoids the bare `/patch` (which would 409 on a merge). Carry change_id, revision_id, parent_count.\n- It fires ONLY on merges (is_merge True) — distinct from `merge_detection` (which logs is_merge for EVERY change).\n- Document it in infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md's merge-change ops signals list.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `merge_change_409_guard` structured event is emitted when the review-bot takes the merge path (is_merge, avoiding the bare /patch 409)\n- [ ] The event does NOT fire on a non-merge change (guard is merge-specific)\n- [ ] A unit test asserts the event fires on a merge and is absent on a non-merge (src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py path via tests/unit/test_review_bot.py)\n- [ ] Documented in infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md merge-change ops signals","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py","reason":"emit merge_change_409_guard at the is_merge guard site"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_review_bot.py","reason":"assert event fires on merge, absent on non-merge"},{"path":"infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","reason":"document the signal"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"987df4e2-60c6-4f89-a6ef-31b5c7663e2b","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"5308-585b-169f-4a35","ticket_type":"task","title":"Emit merge_change_409_guard event on merge-change 409 guard path (S2 follow-up)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5f6fa5cd-316d-44a4-a4cf-64a935f52ef9","3264ec7e-480a-4c39-b242-90c947e62433","20c712d8-6cf8-4191-a7c4-0cfd43b4471f","38d95f4e-577a-4148-b773-a26877d6086f","d1ea8b7e-e9e2-467d-91dc-ed2a3bbe749d","987df4e2-60c6-4f89-a6ef-31b5c7663e2b","e8840c81-f444-4316-b6c2-ca853b12e0dc","736f8026-9463-4ce9-855a-ed25d67f81bd","dee2328c-c1e4-4f3a-8fb2-3eef9bd3ac5c"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993634762353001,"uuid":"6fca4575-49e0-43ab-b633-104e2ba8be10"}